{"3905480": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Rush Minutes: Online Shooter", "steam_appid": 3905480, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fast-Paced PVP Rounds</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instant match, instant action! Jump onto the airship, take control of the skies, and rain down fire. Each battle is short and intense, but guaranteed to get your adrenaline pumping!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905480/extras/66d5378819f058135ab7d3676d9151d8.avif?t=1764310487\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiple Modes, Countless Maps</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a constantly growing selection of maps and game modes. Whether you prefer to go solo in free-for-all battles, team up in squad-based showdowns, fight off giant mechs in PVE missions, or enjoy party-style modes like Star Grab — there's always something new to try.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905480/extras/388345290884b25cc9ec254edc47e718.avif?t=1764310487\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Insane Weapon Combos</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a wide variety of weapons and gear to match your style. From bouncing projectiles to unpredictable melee tools, every match feels fresh and full of chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905480/extras/c3c62c3600c0d881d504652e70f9d0e3.avif?t=1764310487\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customizable Characters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dress up your fighter with hundreds of free outfits, emotes, and accessories. Go full try-hard or full clown — it’s your battlefield persona.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905480/extras/7e2e12c81fdadf396a3154dc13d9c2bc.avif?t=1764310487\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play With Friends</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Squad up in this online shooting party and enjoy casual mayhem with friends or strangers from around the world. Whether it's couch laughter or competitive chaos, it's always a blast.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905480/extras/e0264d5f88b54ee6fd893c416098ea08.avif?t=1764310487\" width=1560 height=812 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fast-Paced PVP Rounds</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instant match, instant action! Jump onto the airship, take control of the skies, and rain down fire. Each battle is short and intense, but guaranteed to get your adrenaline pumping!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905480/extras/66d5378819f058135ab7d3676d9151d8.avif?t=1764310487\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiple Modes, Countless Maps</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a constantly growing selection of maps and game modes. Whether you prefer to go solo in free-for-all battles, team up in squad-based showdowns, fight off giant mechs in PVE missions, or enjoy party-style modes like Star Grab — there's always something new to try.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905480/extras/388345290884b25cc9ec254edc47e718.avif?t=1764310487\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Insane Weapon Combos</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a wide variety of weapons and gear to match your style. From bouncing projectiles to unpredictable melee tools, every match feels fresh and full of chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905480/extras/c3c62c3600c0d881d504652e70f9d0e3.avif?t=1764310487\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customizable Characters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dress up your fighter with hundreds of free outfits, emotes, and accessories. Go full try-hard or full clown — it’s your battlefield persona.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905480/extras/7e2e12c81fdadf396a3154dc13d9c2bc.avif?t=1764310487\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play With Friends</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Squad up in this online shooting party and enjoy casual mayhem with friends or strangers from around the world. Whether it's couch laughter or competitive chaos, it's always a blast.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905480/extras/e0264d5f88b54ee6fd893c416098ea08.avif?t=1764310487\" width=1560 height=812 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Rush Minutes — A fun and lively multiplayer shooter! Fast-paced action, surprises everywhere! Customize a wild character, grab wacky weapons, and go crazy with your friends!", "supported_languages": "English, French, Spanish - Spain, Russian, Traditional Chinese, Simplified Chinese, Portuguese - Portugal", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/390548